## Data Structures

### FactV1

The core fact structure representing a subject-predicate-object triple:

```rust
pub struct FactV1 {
    pub subject: EntityId,      // Entity identifier
    pub predicate: PredId,      // Predicate identifier  
    pub object: ValueAtom,      // Value (typed)
    pub ts_vclock: u64,        // Virtual clock timestamp
    pub provenance: String,     // Source/provenance info
}
```

### ValueAtom

Typed value storage supporting multiple data types:

```rust
pub enum ValueAtom {
    U64(u64),
    I64(i64), 
    F64(f64),
    Bool(bool),
    Bytes(Vec<u8>),
    String(String),
}
```

### EntityId and PredId

Strongly typed identifiers for entities and predicates:

```rust
pub struct EntityId(pub u128);
pub struct PredId(pub u64);
```
